# samples
#
# The nine files MockFinancialDataService reads ARE tracked. They used to be
# fully ignored, which meant MOCK=True only worked on a machine that had already
# run generate_statement_samples -- a fresh clone (and CI) got FileNotFoundError
# -> 500 on every mocked endpoint. Tests and workflows must not depend on
# gitignored files; see .claude/feature-map.md trap 12.
#
# dip_rows.json is the important one: the generator's FILES dict omits it, so it
# is hand-maintained and NOT regenerable. It existed only on one machine.
#
# These are generated, and generate_statement_samples writes them in place, so
# regenerating will show a diff. That is informative, not a problem.
#
# The files below are read by zero code paths (the generator's own IGNORED list
# calls this out), so tracking them is pure noise.
server/corecomp/pages/statement_samples/*_no_data.json
server/corecomp/pages/statement_samples/shares_outstanding.json

